    "description": "This project involved integrating two externally hosted loan origination systems with an internally hosted loan document prep systems to provide a more structured set of loan documents for both the Consumer and Commercial Lending Groups.  This Solution would allow for greater volume of loan documentation to be prepared internally in a shorter amount of time as well as meet satisfy compliance objectives.  The finalized loan documents would be published to sharepoint to be retrieved in an automated fashion by the Loan Officers of the bank.  \nResponsibilities:\nAssisted Lead Developers with gathering system requirements.\nSetup the .Net development environment which consisted of Visual Studio 2010 IIS 7, MSSQL 2008, Beanstalk Cloud SVN service \nCreated WCF Services responsible for communicating and providing real time updates to create loan documentation from incoming requests from the Loan consumer origination systems.\nOptimized queries within existing SQL stored procedures\nAssisted with Unit testing with Nunit and participated in code reviews \n\nEnvironment: C# .Net.4.0 Ajax, MS-SQL Server 2008, XML, SOAP, JavaScript, Sharepoint 2010, COM+",
